# Purpose

This document defines how Tailwind CSS is used throughout the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure Tailwind serves as the implementation layer of the design system, enabling consistent, maintainable, and scalable user interfaces across the product.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Tailwind philosophy
* Utility architecture
* Design token implementation
* Layout principles
* Styling consistency
* Tailwind governance

It intentionally excludes component implementation, framework-specific behavior, application styling, and visual design decisions, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to styling implementation, ensuring visual consistency is achieved through shared systems rather than individual developer preference.

---

